                                                "sense_id": "f883f134-d82d-352a-aa40-6271af5f9631",
                                                "text": "It was the kind of joint you wouldn't want your boss to see you in."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c22d6620-5f16-4ba0-b937-be5cdf6b63b9",
                                                "sense_id": "f883f134-d82d-352a-aa40-6271af5f9631",
                                                "text": "\"...Where's the ladies' in this joint? I've to powder me nose.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4f3e6ae-9773-42b4-b3d1-00303f74b2c1",
                                                "sense_id": "f883f134-d82d-352a-aa40-6271af5f9631",
                                                "text": "For a minute I stayed away from real crowded places like Big Ben's and even the new Ruthless spot, but I hung out in a few smaller Harlem joints when I wasn't running and lifting weights and getting ready for training camp."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1c5c948-f27e-4205-b60b-a84e6b7ad363",
                                                "sense_id": "f883f134-d82d-352a-aa40-6271af5f9631",
                                                "text": "Sham Shui Po might be one of Hong Kong’s poorest neighbourhoods but it has a rich immigrant history and a glut of fantastic street-food joints."
